===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{label|en|Internet}} A computer program used to navigate the [[World Wide Web]], chiefly by viewing [[web page]]s and following [[hyperlink]]s.

====Usage notes====
* The relevant sense of {{m|en|web}} is often capitalized, especially in more formal usage; hence, the capitalization {{m|en|Web browser}} may often be found.

====Hypernyms====
* {{l|en|user agent}}

